---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stop Looking Awkward In Photos"
  description="10 effortless prompts for women who freeze when a camera appears."
>
  <main>
    <section class="product-hero">
      <div class="product-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">FREE GUIDE</p>

        <h1>Stop Looking Awkward In Photos</h1>

        <p class="product-intro">
          10 effortless prompts for women who freeze when a camera appears.
        </p>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="https://payhip.com/b/ktRaS"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Get the free guide
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-introduction">
      <div class="product-introduction-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE IDEA</p>

        <h2>You don't need to know how to pose.</h2>

        <p>
          Most people don't hate photos because of how they look. They hate
          the feeling of being watched while trying to look natural.
        </p>

        <p>
          This guide takes a different approach. Instead of giving you another
          list of poses, it gives you simple things to do while the camera is
          there.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-scenes">
      <div class="scene">
  <img
    src="/products/stop-looking-awkward/coffee-shop-01.jpg"
    alt="Woman reading a menu in a coffee shop"
    loading="lazy"
  />

  <p>01 — The Coffee Shop Prompt</p>
</div>

      <div class="scene">
        <img
          src="/products/stop-looking-awkward/choosing-flowers.jpg"
          alt="Woman choosing flowers at a flower shop"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p>02 — The Flowers Prompt</p>
      </div>

      <div class="scene">
        <img
          src="/products/stop-looking-awkward/walking.jpg"
          alt="Woman walking along a town street"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p>03 — The Walking Prompt</p>
      </div>

      <div class="scene">
        <img
          src="/products/stop-looking-awkward/packing-a-bag.jpg"
          alt="Woman packing a bag at home"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p>04 — The Preparation Prompt</p>
      </div>

      <div class="scene scene-wide">
        <img
          src="/products/stop-looking-awkward/bookstore.jpg"
          alt="Woman looking through a book in a bookstore"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p>05 — The Book Prompt</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-closing">
      <p class="eyebrow">ONE SMALL SHIFT</p>

      <h2>Stop trying to look natural. Start doing something.</h2>

      <a
        class="button"
        href="https://payhip.com/b/ktRaS"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Get the free guide
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>